## 🧹 Cleanup

### Remove SonarQube container
```bash
docker stop sonarqube && docker rm sonarqube
```

### Full EC2 teardown
```bash
sudo systemctl stop jenkins docker

sudo apt-get remove --purge -y jenkins
sudo rm -f /etc/apt/sources.list.d/jenkins.list
sudo rm -f /etc/apt/keyrings/jenkins-keyring.asc

sudo apt-get remove --purge -y docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io
sudo rm -f /etc/apt/sources.list.d/docker.list
sudo rm -f /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc

sudo apt-get remove --purge -y trivy
sudo rm -f /etc/apt/sources.list.d/trivy.list
sudo rm -f /etc/apt/keyrings/trivy.gpg

sudo apt-get remove --purge -y openjdk-21-jre

sudo rm -rf /usr/local/aws-cli /usr/local/bin/aws

sudo rm -rf /opt/dependency-check

sudo rm -f /usr/bin/yq

sudo apt-get autoremove -y && sudo apt-get clean
```
